WEBVTT

00:09:01.036 --> 00:09:04.596
The cost of doing this is almost nothing,
but the effect is huge.

00:09:04.636 --> 00:09:07.276
It's not the catering companies
fault there's no lift.

00:09:07.276 --> 00:09:10.676
They've just gone out of their way
to offer an alternative

00:09:10.716 --> 00:09:13.036
despite the limitations of the hotel.

00:09:13.076 --> 00:09:15.916
In other words,
the catering company themselves

00:09:15.956 --> 00:09:19.236
have become more welcoming,
inclusive and accessible.

00:09:20.156 --> 00:09:21.796
So the first part of this story

00:09:21.796 --> 00:09:24.956
where I explained the restaurant
has upstairs seating, but no lift.

00:09:24.956 --> 00:09:26.796
That could be seen as an audit.

00:09:26.836 --> 00:09:29.236
"We realize there's no lift
to the upstairs seating

00:09:29.236 --> 00:09:32.116
so disabled people
in wheelchairs cannot use it."